   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Farmer Saldean",
   "npc": "233",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Rough times, huh, $n? No matter where you turn someone needs help, and my wife and I are no exception.",
   "time": 1791700840,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "234|eba492ed": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Gryan Stoutmantle",
   "npc": "234",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "A foul corruption has crept into Westfall.  While I was upholding my duty on the battlefields of Lordaeron these honest farms were overrun and made into hide-outs for thugs and murderers. The People's Militia needs your help.",
   "time": 1791700982,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Sentinel Tower"
  },
  "235|f83ef93f": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Salma Saldean",
   "npc": "235",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to our humble abode!  It's always nice to see a friendly face.  And what strong arms you have.  My husband and I are always looking for help around the farm.  Now that most the good folk have left, it's hard to find an able body to help out.",
   "time": 1791700854,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "238|a3fa5a16": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Verna Furlbrow",
   "npc": "238",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Sometimes I think there's a big gray cloud in the sky, just raining down bad luck upon us.  First, we're driven off our land, and now we can't even get out of Westfall.  Everything's a mess.  Something needs to be done.",
   "time": 1791700306,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
  "253092|e0247c5d": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1436,
   "name": "Alba Fairmoon",
   "npc": "253092",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "High Order Skyborne",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I am told the farms of Westfall once supplied a bounty of crops for Stormwind. But now, the soil is barren and most of the farmers have fled.\r\n\r\nOn behalf of Darnassus I would like to offer my aid in replenishing this land. Will you assist me?",
   "time": 1791701040,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "Westfall"
  },
